{"headword":"יָחַל","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.Niph.</strong> wait; <strong>Pi.</strong> await <strong>(</strong>cf. NH <span dir=\"rtl\">יִחוּל</span><em>expectation</em><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נוֹחֲלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.5\">Ez 19:5</a> (yet v. infr.); Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּיָּ֫חֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:12\" href=\"/Genesis.8.12\">Gn 8:12</a> + <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.18\">1 S 13:18</a> Kt (v. Dr; Qr Hiph. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיּוֹחֶל</span>);—<em>wait:</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:12\" href=\"/Genesis.8.12\">Gn 8:12</a> <em>and he waited</em> yet seven days; so <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.8\">1 S 13:8</a> Kt; of Isr. under fig. of lioness, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתֵּרֶא כִּי נוֹחֲלָה אָֽבְדָה תִּקְוָתָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.5\">Ez 19:5</a> <em>when she saw that her hope tarried, was lost</em> (but dub.; Sm comp. Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܘܚܠ</span> <em>be weak</em>, whence perhaps <em>sink down;</em> Hi (perhaps after 𝔊) <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּי נִדַּח לָהּ</span> <em>that he was thrust away from her;</em> Co plausibly <span dir=\"rtl\">נוֹאֲלָה</span> that <em>she had acted foolishly</em>)."}],"form":"Niph."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 2 ms. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִחַלִתָּ֑נִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:49\" href=\"/Psalms.119.49\">ψ 119:49</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִחָ֑לְתִּי</span> v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:43\" href=\"/Psalms.119.43\">43</a> + 4 times <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119\" href=\"/Psalms.119\">ψ 119</a>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִחֲלוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 29:23\" href=\"/Job.29.23\">Jb 29:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.6\">Ez 13:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִחֵ֑לּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 29:21\" href=\"/Job.29.21\">Jb 29:21</a>; 1 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִחַלְנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 33:22\" href=\"/Psalms.33.22\">ψ 33:22</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְיַחֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 5:6\" href=\"/Micah.5.6\">Mi 5:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲיַחֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:11\" href=\"/Job.6.11\">Jb 6:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 13:15\" href=\"/Job.13.15\">13:15</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲיַחֲלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 30:26\" href=\"/Job.30.26\">30:26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְיַחֵ֑לוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.4\">Is 42:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְיַחֵלֽוּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.5\">51:5</a>; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 130:7\" href=\"/Psalms.130.7\">ψ 130:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 131:3\" href=\"/Psalms.131.3\">131:3</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְיחֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:4\" href=\"/Psalms.69.4\">69:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְיַחֲלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:25\" href=\"/Psalms.31.25\">31:25</a> + 2 times;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>wait, tarry</em> for, sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 5:6\" href=\"/Micah.5.6\">Mi 5:6</a> (of rain, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יְקֵוֶּה</span>); so <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:12\" href=\"/Micah.1.12\">1:12</a> according to We, who reads <span dir=\"rtl\">יִחֲלָה</span> (Pf.) for <span dir=\"rtl\">חָלָה</span>; abs. <em>wait</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:11\" href=\"/Job.6.11\">Jb 6:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 14:14\" href=\"/Job.14.14\">14:14</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>wait for</em> = <em>hope for</em>, sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.4\">Is 42:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 29:21\" href=\"/Job.29.21\">Jb 29:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 29:23\" href=\"/Job.29.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 30:26\" href=\"/Job.30.26\">30:26</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קִוֵּיתִי</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:25\" href=\"/Psalms.31.25\">ψ 31:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 33:18\" href=\"/Psalms.33.18\">33:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 33:22\" href=\"/Psalms.33.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:4\" href=\"/Psalms.69.4\">69:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:43\" href=\"/Psalms.119.43\">119:43</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:74\" href=\"/Psalms.119.74\">74</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:81\" href=\"/Psalms.119.81\">81</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:114\" href=\"/Psalms.119.114\">114</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:147\" href=\"/Psalms.119.147\">147</a>; sq. ל inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ויח׳ לְקַיֵּם דָּבָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.6\">Ez 13:6</a>; sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.5\">Is 51:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 130:7\" href=\"/Psalms.130.7\">ψ 130:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 131:3\" href=\"/Psalms.131.3\">131:3</a>; abs. <em>hope</em>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:14\" href=\"/Psalms.71.14\">ψ 71:14</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"caus. <em>make to hope</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:11\" href=\"/Psalms.147.11\">ψ 147:11</a> (sf. pers.),"}],"num":"3."}],"form":"Pi."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹחַ֫לְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 32:11\" href=\"/Job.32.11\">Jb 32:11</a>, etc.; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהוֹחַ֫לְתִּי</span> (consec., v. Hi De<sup>2</sup> Dr<sup>§§ 106, 119 γ</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Job 32:16\" href=\"/Job.32.16\">Jb 32:16</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיּ֫וֹחֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.8\">1 S 13:8</a> Qr; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹחֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.8\">10:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹחִיל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:33\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.33\">2 K 6:33</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:21\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.21\">La 3:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:24\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.24\">24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹחִ֫ילָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.19\">Je 4:19</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">אָחוּלָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:7\" href=\"/Micah.7.7\">Mi 7:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹחִילָה</sp